      "source_quote": "太傅東海王鎮許昌，以王安期為記室參軍",
      "note": "稱官為太傅及鎮許昌。",
      "source_sha256": "e2ec15441d5cabbac9f4beea7a9f4f6c58db0a4e5537ff3ae0134c68bd8caa48"
    },
    {
      "path": "sources/shishuoxinyu/shishuo008-ws1532652.wikitext",
      "revision": 1532652,
      "line": 41,
      "start": 71,
      "end": 84,
      "source_quote": "王參軍人倫之表，汝其師之！",
      "note": "傳主王承一人的說法。",
      "source_sha256": "e2ec15441d5cabbac9f4beea7a9f4f6c58db0a4e5537ff3ae0134c68bd8caa48"
    },
    {
      "path": "sources/shishuoxinyu/shishuo008-ws1532652.wikitext",
      "revision": 1532652,
      "line": 41,
      "start": 89,
      "end": 102,
      "source_quote": "王、趙、鄧三參軍，人倫之表",
      "note": "正文另載三人說。",
      "source_sha256": "e2ec15441d5cabbac9f4beea7a9f4f6c58db0a4e5537ff3ae0134c68bd8caa48"
    },
    {
      "path": "sources/shishuoxinyu/shishuo008-ws1532652.wikitext",
      "revision": 1532652,
      "line": 41,
      "start": 163,
      "end": 179,
      "source_quote": "太傅越與穆及王承、阮瞻、鄧攸書曰",
      "note": "劉注所引趙吳郡行狀另書四位受信人。",
      "source_sha256": "e2ec15441d5cabbac9f4beea7a9f4f6c58db0a4e5537ff3ae0134c68bd8caa48"
    },
    {
      "path": "sources/shishuoxinyu/shishuo008-ws1532652.wikitext",
      "revision": 1532652,
      "line": 41,
      "start": 247,
      "end": 256,
      "source_quote": "小兒毗既無令淑之資",
      "note": "越在引書中自稱毗為兒。",
      "source_sha256": "e2ec15441d5cabbac9f4beea7a9f4f6c58db0a4e5537ff3ae0134c68bd8caa48"
    },
    {
      "path": "sources/shishuoxinyu/shishuo008-ws1532652.wikitext",
      "revision": 1532652,
      "line": 41,
      "start": 306,
      "end": 317,
      "source_quote": "袁宏作名士傳直云王參軍",
      "note": "注文引事後的版本敘語，稱袁宏所錄一人。",
      "source_sha256": "e2ec15441d5cabbac9f4beea7a9f4f6c58db0a4e5537ff3ae0134c68bd8caa48"
    },
